syntax "gengo" "\.gengo$"

## Keywords
icolor brightyellow "(\<(assert|break|case|const|continue|cycle|default|defer|else|enum|false|for|func|if|import|in|interface|null|predicate|pub|range|return|struct|subtype|switch|test|trap|true|type|var|variant)\>)"

## Built-in types
icolor brightcyan "(\<(int|float|bool|string|any)\>)"

## Numbers (decimal integer, float, scientific)
icolor brightmagenta "\<-\?[0-9][0-9_]*\(\.[0-9][0-9_]*\)\?\([eE][+-]\?[0-9]\+\)\?\>"

## Rune literals
icolor brightgreen "`[^`]`"

## Double-quoted strings
icolor brightgreen ""[^"]*""

## Single-quoted raw strings
icolor brightgreen "'[^']*'"

## Multiline raw string lines
icolor brightgreen "^\\\\"

## Comments
icolor brightblue "//.*$"
